block content
  main.legal(data-screen-label="Terms")
    .wrap.legal__inner
      a.legal__home(href="/") ← Buried Worlds VR

      .section-head
        .ornament
          span.rule
          span.diamond
          span.rule
        h1.h2 Terms of Service
        p.serif-italic The agreement between you and us, in plain English.

      .legal__body
        p.legal__meta Last updated 4 August 2026

        h2.legal__h The short version
        p.
          Buy the game, play it, enjoy it. Don't copy it, sell it or pull it
          apart. It is still being made, so it will change. Your saves live on
          your headset and we cannot recover them. And if something goes wrong,
          you keep every right the law gives you — nothing here takes those
          away.

        h2.legal__h Who we are
        p.
          Buried Worlds VR is made by Bellare Studios, in Melbourne, Australia.
          These terms cover this website and the Buried Worlds VR game. By using
          either, you are agreeing to them.

        h2.legal__h Buying and playing the game
        p.
          Buried Worlds VR is distributed through the Meta Horizon Store. Buying it
          is a transaction between you and Meta, under Meta's terms — payment,
          your account, and refunds are all handled by Meta rather than by us.
          If you want a refund, Meta is who to ask.
        p.
          What you get is a personal licence to play the game on your own
          headset for as long as that store licence lasts. You are not buying
          the game itself, and the licence cannot be passed to someone else.

        h2.legal__h A game still being dug out
        p.
          Buried Worlds VR is in active development, and some builds are released
          for testing. Expect it to change. Destinations may be added, reworked,
          or held back while they are finished; rewards and prices will be
          rebalanced; test builds may contain faults. We do not promise that any
          particular feature will exist, keep behaving the same way, or arrive
          on a particular date.
        p.
          If you are playing from a test channel, please treat what you find
          there as unfinished work.

        h2.legal__h Your saves
        p.
          Your progress is stored on your headset and nowhere else. We hold no
          copy of it and have no way to restore it. Uninstalling the game,
          resetting the headset or a failed device will lose it. If a change to
          the game ever means older saves cannot be read, we will say so before
          it ships.

        h2.legal__h Fair use
        p Please do not:
        ul.legal__list
          li copy, share, sell or redistribute the game or its files
          li reverse engineer it, or work around the store's licence check
          li modify it to cheat, or pass off a modified build as ours
          li use our name, artwork or logo to imply we endorse something we do not

        p.
          Recording, streaming and making videos of your own play is welcome,
          including monetised ones. You do not need to ask us.

        h2.legal__h What belongs to whom
        p.
          The game — its code, artwork, music, name and logo — belongs to us.
          The real places and histories it draws on, from gold rushes to Roman
          hoards, are facts of the world and belong to nobody.
        p.
          Anything you post in our Discord or on Reddit lives under those
          platforms' terms. What you make stays yours; just do not post things
          you have no right to share.

        h2.legal__h Guarantees, and their limits
        p.
          We build the game as carefully as we can, but we cannot promise it
          will be free of faults or run perfectly on every device. Except where
          the law says otherwise, we are not liable for indirect losses such as
          lost time, lost data, or losses that could not reasonably have been
          foreseen.
        p.
          Nothing in these terms excludes, restricts or modifies any right or
          guarantee you have under the Australian Consumer Law, or under any
          other law that cannot be excluded. Where such a guarantee applies and
          we fail to meet it, you have the remedies that law provides, whatever
          else this page says.

        h2.legal__h This website
        p
          | The site exists to tell you about the game and point you to our
          | community. It asks nothing of you and stores nothing about you —
          | see the #[a(href="/privacy") privacy policy]. It links out to other
          | services, and what happens on those is between you and them.

        h2.legal__h Changes
        p.
          We will update these terms as the game grows, and change the date at
          the top when we do. If something significant changes, we will say so
          in the community rather than hoping you notice.

        h2.legal__h Getting in touch
        p
          | Questions about any of this are best asked on #[a(href=links.discord target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer") our Discord].
          | These terms are governed by the laws of Victoria, Australia.

  +footer(links)
